  "basis": "The dashboard displays a clear positive linear trend where higher advertising spend is associated with higher sales across the five plotted quarters (Q2 to Q6). However, the chart title explicitly states 'Selected High-Growth Quarters,' indicating that the data shown is a subset of the total. Because the view excludes lower-performing quarters and lacks a baseline for overall average performance, the evidence is insufficient to justify a broader budget increase based on this view alone. Therefore, the appropriate decision is to hold and request a full-data analysis to evaluate the impact on the entire portfolio.",
